{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you unsure as to what Piczle puzzles you enjoy most? Or are you just hungry for more, more, <i>more</i>? The Piczle World of Puzzles <strong>Starter Pack</strong> will add <strong>4 Piczle Cross puzzle packs</strong>,\u00a0<strong>4 Piczle Color Cross puzzle packs </strong>and <strong>4 Piczle Lines puzzle packs</strong>, delivering over 250 individual puzzles to keep your brain occupied!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/extras/f66976f93f39a114b08c1d6c5f31ae74.avif?t=1761267846\" width=800 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The four Piczle Cross puzzle packs:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Small Puzzles</strong>, 30 puzzles from 5x5 to 10x10 to ease you into solving nonograms, or for when you just want a quick distraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junk food</strong>, 25 puzzles that, like our favourite snacks themselves, range from big to small and can be a little more challenging to clear than to eat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jobs</strong>, 25 puzzles that can be quite a bit of work to clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And <strong>Animals</strong>, 25 puzzles that grow in size and complexity to keep you busy for a while!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/extras/1de23c2db1faf81ab0029499bb2e8461.avif?t=1761267846\" width=786 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The four Piczle Color Cross puzzle packs:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Japan</strong>, 25 puzzles and 1 collage celebrating Japan and its traditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sea</strong>. 25 puzzles themed around the sea, its creatures and activities therein.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summer</strong>, 25 relaxing puzzles based on summer themes and vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And <strong>Farm</strong>, 25 puzzles based on farm life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/extras/7baf298a81f59a4c5c19e7b602114b32.avif?t=1761267846\" width=780 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The four Piczle Lines puzzle packs:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbols</strong>, 20 puzzles that are small and easy to get you started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flags of the World</strong>, 20 medium sized puzzles to ease you into the more challenging Piczle Lines puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Japanese Yokai</strong>, 20 spooky puzzles that teach you about various Japanese spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And <strong>Adventure party</strong>,\u00a0 12 chunky puzzles depicting various role playing characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And on top of that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/extras/58998702ad65dc2d8beff40dc3718d28.avif?t=1761267846\" width=708 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...five new profile styles, red, orange, cheese, night drive and knitted, and to adorn them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/extras/9a9dda496f97db606d9411c88042ed5c.avif?t=1761267846\" width=485 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...five more profile stickers to show off your Piczle personality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NOTE: These profile styles and stickers are exclusive to owners of this DLC.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064330?t=1761267846","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4064330?t=1761267846","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/274fd3af89b9062c8d5480a13750f337e272c7de/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761267846","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/274fd3af89b9062c8d5480a13750f337e272c7de/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761267846","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you unsure as to what Piczle puzzles you enjoy most? Or are you just hungry for more, more, <i>more</i>? The Piczle World of Puzzles <strong>Starter Pack</strong> will add <strong>4 Piczle Cross puzzle packs</strong>,\u00a0<strong>4 Piczle Color Cross puzzle packs </strong>and <strong>4 Piczle Lines puzzle packs</strong>, delivering over 250 individual puzzles to keep your brain occupied!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/extras/f66976f93f39a114b08c1d6c5f31ae74.avif?t=1761267846\" width=800 height=265 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The four Piczle Cross puzzle packs:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Small Puzzles</strong>, 30 puzzles from 5x5 to 10x10 to ease you into solving nonograms, or for when you just want a quick distraction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Junk food</strong>, 25 puzzles that, like our favourite snacks themselves, range from big to small and can be a little more challenging to clear than to eat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jobs</strong>, 25 puzzles that can be quite a bit of work to clear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And <strong>Animals</strong>, 25 puzzles that grow in size and complexity to keep you busy for a while!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/extras/1de23c2db1faf81ab0029499bb2e8461.avif?t=1761267846\" width=786 height=266 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The four Piczle Color Cross puzzle packs:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Japan</strong>, 25 puzzles and 1 collage celebrating Japan and its traditions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The sea</strong>. 25 puzzles themed around the sea, its creatures and activities therein.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Summer</strong>, 25 relaxing puzzles based on summer themes and vibes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And <strong>Farm</strong>, 25 puzzles based on farm life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/extras/7baf298a81f59a4c5c19e7b602114b32.avif?t=1761267846\" width=780 height=235 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The four Piczle Lines puzzle packs:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Symbols</strong>, 20 puzzles that are small and easy to get you started.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flags of the World</strong>, 20 medium sized puzzles to ease you into the more challenging Piczle Lines puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Japanese Yokai</strong>, 20 spooky puzzles that teach you about various Japanese spirits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And <strong>Adventure party</strong>,\u00a0 12 chunky puzzles depicting various role playing characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And on top of that...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/extras/58998702ad65dc2d8beff40dc3718d28.avif?t=1761267846\" width=708 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...five new profile styles, red, orange, cheese, night drive and knitted, and to adorn them...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/extras/9a9dda496f97db606d9411c88042ed5c.avif?t=1761267846\" width=485 height=142 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...five more profile stickers to show off your Piczle personality!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>NOTE: These profile styles and stickers are exclusive to owners of this DLC.</i></p>","developers":["Score Studios LLC"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2174300","name":"Piczle World of Puzzles"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4064330/08b45318154993878632b93c10535870fd83ac18/header.jpg?t=1761267846","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Score Studios LLC","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Piczle World of Puzzles: Starter Pack","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":[],"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating